<title>VIETNAM: Rubin says dlr been strong for awhile, helping U.S.</title>
<headline>Rubin says dlr been strong for awhile, helping U.S.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury Secretary Robert Rubin repeated on Monday that the dollar has been strong for &quot;quite some time&quot; and that this has been helpful to the U.S. economy.</p>
</text>
